WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.493
The MP Report Generator creates personalised investigation links for each of Canada's three hundred and forty Members of Parliament.

00:00:07.443 --> 00:00:13.261
Clean MPs see the full investigation picture and become potential allies for structural reform.

00:00:13.261 --> 00:00:21.909
Flagged MPs receive scorecards showing their peers' criminal convictions and ethics violations — they think they have ammunition, but the data catches everyone.

00:00:21.909 --> 00:00:30.113
This is game theory applied to parliamentary accountability: every MP gets a mirror, and the reflection is sourced from their own public record.
